==============================================================================
  Objective : Demonstrate successful protection, transmission, verification and recovery of valid application records.
  Procedure :
              1. Establish a session over a pre-shared key.
              2. Protect a series of application records of differing sizes.
              3. Deliver each protected record to the receiver.
              4. Confirm each recovered record equals the original, byte for byte.
