 TR-5  Replay Test                                                 [aes-gcm]
==============================================================================
  Objective : Demonstrate that replay of a previously accepted protected application record is detected and handled per the documented replay handling strategy.
  Procedure :
              1. Deliver a record and confirm acceptance.
              2. Malicious actor re-sends the identical record.
              3. Confirm the AEAD alone would accept it, but the subsystem does not.
              4. Exercise out-of-order delivery, stale records and window poisoning.
  Input     : A byte-identical copy of an already-accepted protected record.
  Expected  : REPLAY_DETECTED; no application record is released.
